    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业季的蝉鸣中，时光悄悄裂开一道缝，有穿越者带着未来的星光，轻轻地落在盛夏里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“2025的我们，你们好！我是2035的我。”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 20250627 咔嚓咔嚓定格我们的那些年</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 20250627 谁是小记者？我！我！我！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 20250630 和星星一起等待黎明</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 20250704 只为你们而设的典礼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>剧本：Juno</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>记者：iiu，Juno</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>声音出演：iiu，Juno，hhr，xlf，lcc，hzm，Bubble</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>串场：Bubble</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
